  "apply": [
    "Each row is independent; start from defaults. Host grant and observed identity/rate/policy match the defaults unless a row changes them. Unspecified settlement submissions have a matching definite outcome unless the row supplies a different observation. Settlement cases start after one matched 16-unit reservation unless stated. Amounts are synthetic integer units only. Reserve input_bound * input_rate + output_bound * output_rate. Track remaining limit as cap minus settled and outstanding exposure in each applicable scope.",
